  "content_html": "<p>From the person who told you that Oracle was at &#8220;<a href=\"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/peak-bubble?r=8tdk6&amp;utm_campaign=post-expanded-share&amp;utm_medium=web\">peak bubble</a>&#8221; when it was trading at over $300 (today&#8217;s price is around $115), here&#8217;s why I (not a professional investor so just giving my own reasoning!) have my doubts about the high valuation for the upcoming Anthropic IPO. </p><p>Either way, as a person who has been warning about risks of AI night and day for the last several years, I would like you to consider not buying Anthropic stock for the sake of humanity.</p><p>I will get to the moral side of the argument at the end. </p><p>But first, the bull case, as I understand it, and then what I think it gets wrong and leaves out.</p><h1>Part I: The bull case</h1><p>Anthropic makes strong AI models,  and arguably, by a small margin, the best.</p><p>Back in October Brad Gerstner made the bull case with this chart:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!z9BV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff5a77562-08b3-4a74-918c-e278ac56185f_1475x1290.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!z9BV!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff5a77562-08b3-4a74-918c-e278ac56185f_1475x1290.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!z9BV!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff5a77562-08b3-4a74-918c-e278ac56185f_1475x1290.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!z9BV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/h