mit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff5a77562-08b3-4a74-918c-e278ac56185f_1475x1290.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!z9BV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff5a77562-08b3-4a74-918c-e278ac56185f_1475x1290.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>And there is also this y-axis monstrosity</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MJ2F!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2bdf2fb2-9777-4c75-aae3-79c123b69d7b_1298x1017.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MJ2F!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2bdf2fb2-9777-4c75-aae3-79c123b69d7b_1298x1017.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MJ2F!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2bdf2fb2-9777-4c75-aae3-79c123b69d7b_1298x1017.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MJ2F!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2bdf2fb2-9777-4c75-aae3-79c123b69d7b