cdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pa6N!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1f3f8db5-2f84-4737-8e21-2c609a82ac6f_1418x956.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The most recent data I have seen shows that the revenue rocket is no longer accelerating as fast as before:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1iSq!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1iSq!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1iSq!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1iSq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1iSq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1iSq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1025\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1025,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:161018,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/225508496?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1iSq!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1iSq!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1iSq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1iSq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e0c035c-0a4c-4ea8-8d40-5de4fa36019b_1964x1382.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The green line represents the widespread fantasy, and roughly the rocket that Anthropic would have needed to make it as a gargantuan sustainable business. The darker bars on the right show that it has already fallen off the pace&#8212;which is why Anthropic probably won&#8217;t make it. Q2 was special, at the height of tokenmaxxing and before Chinese models (perhaps thanks to the largesse of Jensen Huang) caught up. Now people have options, and they watch their token spend more carefully, which means revenue has leveled out.</p><p>Another misconception is to believe that Dario can deliver on his wilder promises, especially around medicine. As I noted in a recent article, those promises are absolutely absurd. We are more likely to get hit by a meteor.</p><p>But what really matters the most is what&#8217;s been <em>left out</em> of the bull case.</p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/is-anthropics-ipo-a-bad-bet-both\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>",
